{
  "name": "FraudNova lead gate (webhook)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FraudNova setup (4 steps)\n\n1. **Credential.** Create a *Header Auth* credential named `FraudNova API`: header name `Authorization`, value `Bearer fn_...`. **The value must be `Bearer ` followed by a space and your key.** Get a key at https://fraudnova.com/dashboard/api-keys, then select the credential in every *Check* node.\n\n2. **Settings.** Open the **Settings** node and set `risk_threshold` (75 = top of the suspicious band, 85 = only the worst).\n\n3. **Connect.** Point your own site or any tool that lets you set the JSON body and read the reply (a custom form handler, another n8n workflow, a Make or Zapier webhook step) at the Webhook node's production URL. POST `{ \"email\", \"ip\", \"phone\"?, \"country\"? }` (`phone` and `country` are accepted but this template does not check them). If `ip` is missing the IP check returns an error and is treated as not checked, so the decision rests on the email alone. A failed check gives `scores: { email: null, ip: null }`.\n\n4. **Cost.** 1 credit per check; a failed or skipped check never marks an item risky.\n\nTemplates and docs: https://github.com/dahleedam/fraudnova-examples/tree/main/examples/n8n",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420
      },
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "fraudnova-lead-gate",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "fraudnova-lead-gate"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "setting-1",
              "name": "risk_threshold",
              "value": 75,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://fraudnova.com/api/v1/check/email",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.email }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "FraudNova API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://fraudnova.com/api/v1/check",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "ip",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.ip }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check IP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "FraudNova API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.disposable === true }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check IP').item.json.success === true && $('Check IP').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check IP').item.json.success === true && ($('Check IP').item.json.data.proxy === true || $('Check IP').item.json.data.vpn === true || $('Check IP').item.json.data.tor === true) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Risky?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { accepted: false, reason: [ ($('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.disposable === true) ? 'disposable_email' : '', ($('Check email').item.json.success === true && $('Check email').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold) ? 'high_email_score' : '', ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true && $('Check IP').item.json.data.fraud_score >= $('Settings').item.json.risk_threshold) ? 'high_ip_score' : '', ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true && ($('Check IP').item.json.data.proxy === true || $('Check IP').item.json.data.vpn === true || $('Check IP').item.json.data.tor === true)) ? 'proxy_vpn_or_tor' : '' ].filter(r => r).join(', '), scores: { email: ($('Check email').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check email').item.json.data.fraud_score : null, ip: ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check IP').item.json.data.fraud_score : null } } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "name": "Respond rejected",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        920,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { accepted: true, scores: { email: ($('Check email').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check email').item.json.data.fraud_score : null, ip: ($('Check IP').item.json.success === true) ? $('Check IP').item.json.data.fraud_score : null } } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "name": "Respond accepted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        920,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check IP",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check IP": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Risky?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Risky?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond rejected",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond accepted",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
